[13, 76894], [20, 77134], [23, 77354], [28, 77534], [33, 77694]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 78482, "end": 86179, "text": "I beg you, brethren, (you know the house of Stephanas, that it is the firstfruits of Achaia, and that they have addicted themselves to the ministry of the saints,)", "words": [[0, 78482], [2, 78602], [6, 78822], [11, 79002], [21, 79822], [26, 79902], [31, 80062], [35, 80182], [41, 80402], [44, 80892], [55, 81382], [60, 81502], [63, 81602], [66, 81742], [70, 82062], [82, 82382], [85, 82672], [93, 82962], [97, 83462], [102, 83602], [107, 83762], [112, 83922], [121, 84222], [132, 84682], [135, 84942], [139, 85062], [148, 85382], [151, 85582], [155, 85702]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 86629, "end": 91241, "text": "That you submit yourselves to such, and to every one that helps with us, and labours.", "words": [[0, 86629], [5, 86820], [9, 86960], [16, 87260], [27, 87760], [30, 87980], [36, 88240], [40, 88740], [43, 88880], [49, 89020], [53, 89160], [58, 89560], [64, 89740], [69, 89980], [73, 90200], [77, 90745]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 91691, "end": 97926, "text": "I am glad of the coming of Stephanas and Fortunatus and Achaicus: for that which was lacking on your part they have supplied.", "words": [[0, 91691], [2, 91851], [5, 91951], [10, 92191], [13, 92351], [17, 92451], [24, 92691], [27, 93061], [37, 93431], [41, 93591], [52, 94211], [56, 94686], [66, 95409], [70, 95529], [75, 95709], [81, 95949], [85, 96149], [93, 96449], [96, 96649], [101, 96789], [106, 97069], [111, 97249], [116, 97349]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 98376, "end": 102835, "text": "For they have refreshed my spirit and yours: therefore acknowledge them that are such.", "words": [[0, 98376], [4, 98472], [9, 98612], [14, 98752], [24, 99112], [27, 99352], [34, 99712], [38, 99992], [45, 100809], [55, 101354], [67, 101714], [72, 102014], [77, 102174], [81, 102314]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 103285, "end": 109204, "text": "The churches of Asia salute you. Aquila and Priscilla salute you much in